(5, 1, 21, 3, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'Yes', 'Yes', '33042_MISTINE_SUNTIMATE_SUNBLOCK_FACIAL_LOTION_SPF50_PA+++_20ML-01.png', 'MISTINE SUNTIMATE SUNBLOCK FACIAL LOTION SPF 50 PA+++ 20ML.', 'MISTINE SUNTIMATE SUNBLOCK FACIAL LOTION SPF 50 PA+++ 20ML.', '\"MISTINE SUNTIMATE SUNBLOCK FACIAL LOTION SPF 50 PA+++ 20ML.\r\n\r\nSunscreen lotion, light texture Easy to spread, waterproof Sweat resistant. Protect skin from UV A, UV B rays.\r\n\r\nHow To use - Apply onto face before applying other makeup To help hide wrinkles and pores to be smooth and consistent\"', '\"MISTINE SUNTIMATE SUNBLOCK FACIAL LOTION SPF 50 PA+++ 20ML.\r\n\r\nSunscreen lotion, light texture Easy to spread, waterproof Sweat resistant. Protect skin from UV A, UV B rays.\r\n\r\nHow To use - Apply onto face before applying other makeup To help hide wrinkles and pores to be smooth and consistent\"', '-', '-', 'admin', '2020-07-07 20:18:15', '172.68.234.82', 'admin', '2020-07-19 17:17:09', '172.68.242.206'),
(8, 1, 21, 3, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '13580_MISTINE_24_COVER_ALL_TRANSLUCENT_LOOSE_POWDER_22G-01.png', 'MISTINE 24 COVER ALL TRANSLUCENT LOOSE POWDER  22 G.', 'MISTINE 24 COVER ALL TRANSLUCENT LOOSE POWDER  22 G.', '\"MISTINE 24 COVER ALL TRANSLUCENT LOOSE POWDER  22 G.\r\n\r\nTranslucent Loose Powder with Oil control. Complete with natural Pomegranate Oil and Avocado Oil for soft skin, moisturizer and pleasant skin. Can be used with all skin colors.\r\n\r\nHow To use: Use the powder puff and gently spread onto your face. After that, use a soft brush to brush off excess powder that sticks on the skin.\"', '-', '\"MISTINE 24 COVER ALL TRANSLUCENT LOOSE POWDER  22 G.\r\n\r\nTranslucent Loose Powder with Oil control. Complete with natural Pomegranate Oil and Avocado Oil for soft skin, moisturizer and pleasant skin. Can be used with all skin colors.\r\n\r\nHow To use: Use the powder puff and gently spread onto your face. After that, use a soft brush to brush off excess powder that sticks on the skin.\"', '-', 'admin', '2020-07-10 09:35:19', '172.68.242.64', 'admin', '2020-07-19 11:24:29', '172.68.242.206'),
