(33, 1, 23, 19, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '14590_MISTINE_THE_PEAK_TIARA_EYEBROW_PENCIL_LINER_NO_02_NATURAL_BROWN-01.png', 'MISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.02 NATURAL BROWN', 'MISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.02 NATURAL BROWN', '\"MISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.02 (NATURAL BROWN)\r\nMISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.03 (LIGHT BROWN)\r\n\r\nTrimming eyebrow pencil with eyebrow mascara 2 in 1 stick. A soft pencil that draw the triangle perfectly with the corner of the eyebrow. Along with the same color eyebrow mascara that will help shape of the eyebrows beautiful.\r\nSide 1: Crayon eyebrow pencil, easy to draw and make it perfect shape.\r\nSide 2: Eyebrow Mascara - Round brush head to reverse the direction of the eyebrows to make the mascara line naturally beautiful.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Draw eyebrows with a pencil then apply the mascara to trim the eyebrows to the desired shape using the opposite direction For the color to stick all over the eyebrows and make the line naturally beautiful.\"', '\"MISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.02 (NATURAL BROWN)\r\nMISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.03 (LIGHT BROWN)\r\n\r\nTrimming eyebrow pencil with eyebrow mascara 2 in 1 stick. A soft pencil that draw the triangle perfectly with the corner of the eyebrow. Along with the same color eyebrow mascara that will help shape of the eyebrows beautiful.\r\nSide 1: Crayon eyebrow pencil, easy to draw and make it perfect shape.\r\nSide 2: Eyebrow Mascara - Round brush head to reverse the direction of the eyebrows to make the mascara line naturally beautiful.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Draw eyebrows with a pencil then apply the mascara to trim the eyebrows to the desired shape using the opposite direction For the color to stick all over the eyebrows and make the line naturally beautiful.\"', '\"MISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.02 (NATURAL BROWN)\r\nMISTINE THE PEAK TIARA EYEBROW&PENCIL LINER NO.03 (LI