(54, 1, 21, 5, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '12078_MISTINE_SPEED_FOUNDATION-01.png', 'MISTINE SPEED FOUNDATION 20ML.', 'MISTINE SPEED FOUNDATION 20ML.', '\"MISTINE SPEED FOUNDATION 20ML.\r\n\r\n Foundation Cream with lightweight, concealing flaws seamlessly revealing smooth skin like pearl skin without stains. Control oil for long time with Balance Undertone Technology that helps diffuse light and adjust skin color to be consistent. Naturally, not dull, like new makeup all day and nourish the skin to be moisturized with Vitamin E and B3. Protect your skin from UVA and UVB rays with SPF30.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Apply foundation on your face at 5 places : forehead, nose, chin and cheeks on both sides and spread evenly over the face.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE SPEED FOUNDATION 20ML.\r\n\r\n Foundation Cream with lightweight, concealing flaws seamlessly revealing smooth skin like pearl skin without stains. Control oil for long time with Balance Undertone Technology that helps diffuse light and adjust skin color to be consistent. Naturally, not dull, like new makeup all day and nourish the skin to be moisturized with Vitamin E and B3. Protect your skin from UVA and UVB rays with SPF30.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Apply foundation on your face at 5 places : forehead, nose, chin and cheeks on both sides and spread evenly over the face.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE SPEED FOUNDATION 20ML.\r\n\r\n Foundation Cream with lightweight, concealing flaws seamlessly revealing smooth skin like pearl skin without stains. Control oil for long time with Balance Undertone Technology that helps diffuse light and adjust skin color to be consistent. Naturally, not dull, like new makeup all day and nourish the skin to be moisturized with Vitamin E and B3. Protect your skin from UVA and UVB rays with SPF30.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Apply foundation on your face at 5 places : forehead, nose, chin and cheeks on both sides and spread evenly over the face.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE SPEED FOUNDATION 20ML.\r\n\r\n Foundation Cream with lightweight, concealing flaws seamlessly revealing smooth skin like pearl skin without stains. Control oil for long time with Balance Undertone Technology that helps diffuse light and adjust skin color to be consistent. Naturally, not dull, like new makeup all day and nourish the skin to be moisturized with Vitamin E and B3. Protect your skin from UVA and UVB rays with SPF30.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Apply foundation on your face at 5 places : forehead, nose, chin and cheeks on both sides and spread evenly over the face.\r\n\"', 'admin', '2020-07-10 11:50:11', '172.68.242.206', 'admin', '2020-07-19 10:26:45', '172.68.242.88'),
(55, 1, 22, 11, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '11135_MISTINE_GLOSSY_POP_COLOR_LIP_CARE_01_2.png', 'MISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE', 'MISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE', '\"MISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE 01 10G.\r\nMISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE 02 10G.\r\nMISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE 03 10G.\r\n\r\nLip care has a long lasting color for 10 hours. The lips are bright and beautiful.\r\nHelps to nourish and brighten the lips for up to 10 hours.\r\n\r\nHow To use - Apply on your lips as often as needed.\"', 'ႏႈတ္ခမ္းသားကို စိုေျပလွပေစၿပီး (၁၀)နာရီ ၾကာစဲြၿမဲေစပါတယ္။\r\n\r\nအသံုးျပဳပံု - ႏႈတ္ခမ္းတြင္ဆိုးေပးရန္။ မိမိိႀကိဳက္ႏွစ္သက္သည့္ အခ်ိန္တိုင္း ဆိုးေပးႏိုင္ပါတယ္။', '\"MISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE 01 10G.\r\nMISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE 02 10G.\r\nMISTINE GLOSSY POP COLOR LIP CARE 03 10G.\r\n\r\nLip care has a long lasting color for 10 hours. The lips are bright and beautiful.\r\nHelps to nourish and brighten the lips for up to 10 hours.\r\n\r\nHow To use - Apply on your lips as often as needed.\"', 'ႏႈတ္ခမ္းသားကို စိုေျပလွပေစၿပီး (၁၀)နာရီ ၾကာစဲြၿမဲေစပါတယ္။\r\n\r\nအသံုးျပဳပံု - ႏႈတ္ခမ္းတြင္ဆိုးေပးရန္။ မိမိိႀကိဳက္ႏွစ္သက္သည့္ အခ်ိန္တိုင္း ဆိုးေပးႏိုင္ပါတယ္။', 'admin', '2020-07-10 11:52:13', '172.68.242.88', 'admin', '2020-07-20 16:08:01', '172.68.242.52'),
(58, 1, 22, 10, 0.00, '5', 'Yes', 'No', 'Yes', '10297_MISTINE_WINGS_EXTRA_SMOOTH_LIPSTICK_01-01.png', 'MISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK', 'MISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK', '\"MISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 01\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 02\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 03\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 04\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 05\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 06\r\n\r\nExtra smooth coverage lipstick with molecular beads.Intense Color gives a beautiful, clear, smooth color covering all the deep lips, so your lips look beautiful. Nourishing lips with Mulberry Leaf Extract, Wheat Germ Oil and Vitamin E to moisturize your lips look healthy.\r\n\r\nHow To use - Apply on your lips as often as needed.\r\n\"', 'ႏႈတ္ခမ္းနီကို Extra Smooth Coverage ျဖင့္ေဖာ္စပ္ထာေသာေၾကာင့္ ႏႈတ္ခမ္းနီအသားက ႏူးညံ့ေနၿပီး Intense Color က စဲြမက္ဖြယ္ေကာင္းတဲ့ အေရာင္ေတြေၾကာင့္ ႏႈတ္ခမ္းသားကို ပိုမိုေတာက္ပ ေပၚလြင္ေစပါတယ္။ Mulberry Leaf Extract, Wheat Germ Oil နဲ႔ Vitamin E  တို႔ျဖင့္ ႏႈတ္ခမ္းသားကို သဘာ၀အတိုင္း စိုေျပေစၿပီး ျမင္သူတကာ ေငးေလာက္ေအာင္ ႏႈတ္ခမ္းက စဲြေဆာင္မႈအျပည့္နဲ႔ ေတာက္ပေနေစပါတယ္။\r\n\r\nအသံုးျပဳပံု - ႏႈတ္ခမ္းသားတြင္ ဆိုးေပးရပါမယ္။', '\"MISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 01\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 02\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 03\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 04\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 05\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 06\r\n\r\nExtra smooth coverage lipstick with molecular beads.Intense Color gives a beautiful, clear, smooth color covering all the deep lips, so your lips look beautiful. Nourishing lips with Mulberry Leaf Extract, Wheat Germ Oil and Vitamin E to moisturize your lips look healthy.\r\n\r\nHow To use - Apply on your lips as often as needed.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 01\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 02\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 03\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 04\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 05\r\nMISTINE WINGS EXTRA SMOOTH LIPSTICK 06\r\n\r\nExtra smooth coverage lipstick with molecular beads.Intense Color gives a beautiful, clear, smooth color covering all the deep lips, so your lips look beautiful. Nourishing lips with Mulberry Leaf Extract, Wheat Germ Oil and Vitamin E to moisturize your lips look healthy.\r\n\r\nHow To use - Apply on your lips as often as needed.\r\n\"', 'admin', '2020-07-10 15:51:34', '172.68.242.64', 'admin', '2020-07-20 10:54:15', '172.68.242.88'),
