(79, 5, 34, 45, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '38014_MISTINE_DENTISS_HERBAL_EXTRACTED_TOOHPASTE-011.png', 'DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED TOOTHPASTE 40G.', 'DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED TOOTHPASTE 40G.', '\"DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED TOOTHPASTE 40G.\r\n\r\nToothpaste mixed with 5 natural herbs extracted, including pure salt and silica teeth cleaning agents. Without flour and sugar. Use only the amount of mung beans.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Brush your teeth with DENTIS herbal toothpaste twice a day.\r\n\"', '\"DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED TOOTHPASTE 40G.\r\n\r\nToothpaste mixed with 5 natural herbs extracted, including pure salt and silica teeth cleaning agents. Without flour and sugar. Use only the amount of mung beans.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Brush your teeth with DENTIS herbal toothpaste twice a day.\r\n\"', '\"DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED TOOTHPASTE 40G.\r\n\r\nToothpaste mixed with 5 natural herbs extracted, including pure salt and silica teeth cleaning agents. Without flour and sugar. Use only the amount of mung beans.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Brush your teeth with DENTIS herbal toothpaste twice a day.\r\n\"', '\"DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED TOOTHPASTE 40G.\r\n\r\nToothpaste mixed with 5 natural herbs extracted, including pure salt and silica teeth cleaning agents. Without flour and sugar. Use only the amount of mung beans.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Brush your teeth with DENTIS herbal toothpaste twice a day.\r\n\"', 'admin', '2020-07-10 17:22:17', '172.68.242.64', 'admin', '2020-07-20 17:07:23', '172.68.242.88'),
