(81, 5, 34, 45, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '38015_MISTINE_DENTISS_HERBAL_EXTRACTED_MOUTHWASH-01.png', 'MISTINE DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED MOUTHWASH 150ML.', 'MISTINE DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED MOUTHWASH 150ML.', '\"MISTINE DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED MOUTHWASH 150ML.\r\n\r\nHerbal Mouthwash complete with natural extracts to increase oral and dental care, thoroughly cleaned, Fresh breath and Healthy Gum. Reduce the accumulation of bacteria, to protect tooth decay and bad breath.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Rinse mouth after you brush your teeth to clean the areas where brushing can not reach.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED MOUTHWASH 150ML.\r\n\r\nHerbal Mouthwash complete with natural extracts to increase oral and dental care, thoroughly cleaned, Fresh breath and Healthy Gum. Reduce the accumulation of bacteria, to protect tooth decay and bad breath.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Rinse mouth after you brush your teeth to clean the areas where brushing can not reach.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED MOUTHWASH 150ML.\r\n\r\nHerbal Mouthwash complete with natural extracts to increase oral and dental care, thoroughly cleaned, Fresh breath and Healthy Gum. Reduce the accumulation of bacteria, to protect tooth decay and bad breath.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Rinse mouth after you brush your teeth to clean the areas where brushing can not reach.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE DENTISS HERBAL EXTRACTED MOUTHWASH 150ML.\r\n\r\nHerbal Mouthwash complete with natural extracts to increase oral and dental care, thoroughly cleaned, Fresh breath and Healthy Gum. Reduce the accumulation of bacteria, to protect tooth decay and bad breath.\r\n\r\nHow to Use - Rinse mouth after you brush your teeth to clean the areas where brushing can not reach.\r\n\"', 'admin', '2020-07-10 17:25:55', '172.68.242.64', 'admin', '2020-07-20 17:06:39', '172.68.242.88'),
