(109, 5, 34, 48, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '37149_MISTINE_ALOE_VERA_(RICH-ORGANIC)_SHAMPOO_400ML_01.png', 'MISTINE ALOE  VERA (RICH-ORGANIC) SHAMPOO 400 ML.', 'MISTINE ALOE  VERA (RICH-ORGANIC) SHAMPOO 400 ML.', '\"MISTINE ALOE  VERA (RICH-ORGANIC) SHAMPOO 400 ML.\r\n\r\nAloe Vera Shampoo formulated with high Technology to help restore dry and damaged hair back to shine. Combined with the power of butterfly pea, avocado and lemon, help to be black and shiny together with Awaken Herbal oil for a fresh scent. Relaxes, nourishes hair to look strong, healthy and shiny hair.\r\n\r\nHow To Use - Apply shampoo to wet hair, gently massage all over the hair and rinse thoroughly with water.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE ALOE  VERA (RICH-ORGANIC) SHAMPOO 400 ML.\r\n\r\nAloe Vera Shampoo formulated with high Technology to help restore dry and damaged hair back to shine. Combined with the power of butterfly pea, avocado and lemon, help to be black and shiny together with Awaken Herbal oil for a fresh scent. Relaxes, nourishes hair to look strong, healthy and shiny hair.\r\n\r\nHow To Use - Apply shampoo to wet hair, gently massage all over the hair and rinse thoroughly with water.\r\n\"', 'none', 'none', 'admin', '2020-07-11 11:21:08', '172.68.242.88', 'admin', '2020-07-20 14:08:55', '172.68.242.52');
