(172, 2, 27, 28, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '30102_MELAKLEAR_WHITE_FACIAL_FOAM_80_G_01.png', 'MELAKLEAR WHITE FACIAL FOAM  80 G.', 'MELAKLEAR WHITE FACIAL FOAM  80 G.', '\"MELAKLEAR WHITE FACIAL FOAM  80 G.\r\n\r\nFacial foam with innovative 2-steps -\r\nStep 1 - Helps to clean dirt deeply throughout the day.\r\nStep 2 - Helps to remove gently for dead skin cells that have deteriorated. And the ultimate combination of innovation in skin care for radiant skin in one step with NANO-ALPHA ARBUTIN Arbutin in the form of nano-liposome, providing superior performance for naturally radiant skin.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Squeeze foam and rub with water until foamy. Apply all over the face then rinse with clean water.\r\n\r\n\"', '\"MELAKLEAR WHITE FACIAL FOAM  80 G.\r\n\r\nFacial foam with innovative 2-steps -\r\nStep 1 - Helps to clean dirt deeply throughout the day.\r\nStep 2 - Helps to remove gently for dead skin cells that have deteriorated. And the ultimate combination of innovation in skin care for radiant skin in one step with NANO-ALPHA ARBUTIN Arbutin in the form of nano-liposome, providing superior performance for naturally radiant skin.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Squeeze foam and rub with water until foamy. Apply all over the face then rinse with clean water.\r\n\r\n\"', 'None', 'None', 'admin', '2020-07-11 15:11:24', '172.68.242.206', 'admin', '2020-07-19 16:03:43', '172.68.242.64'),
