(195, 2, 27, 28, 0.00, '5', 'No', 'No', 'No', '30087_MISTINE_EXTRA_OIL_CONTROL_ACNE_CLEAR_FACIAL_FOAM-01.png', 'MISTINE EXTRA OIL CONTROL & ACNE CLEAR FACIAL FOAM 85G.', 'MISTINE EXTRA OIL CONTROL & ACNE CLEAR FACIAL FOAM 85G.', '\"MISTINE EXTRA OIL CONTROL & ACNE CLEAR FACIAL FOAM 85G.\r\n\r\nFacial Cleansing Foam for acne. Helps reduce the accumulation of bacteria. which is the cause of acne to smooth, clear skin with a foam cream particles small amino acid cleansing agent is effective in cleaning Skin deeply.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Squeeze foam and rub with water until foamy. Apply all over the face then rinse with clean water.\r\n\"', '\"MISTINE EXTRA OIL CONTROL & ACNE CLEAR FACIAL FOAM 85G.\r\n\r\nFacial Cleansing Foam for acne. Helps reduce the accumulation of bacteria. which is the cause of acne to smooth, clear skin with a foam cream particles small amino acid cleansing agent is effective in cleaning Skin deeply.\r\n\r\nHow to use - Squeeze foam and rub with water until foamy. Apply all over the face then rinse with clean water.\r\n\"', 'None', 'None', 'admin', '2020-07-12 15:38:56', '172.68.242.206', 'admin', '2020-07-19 15:44:53', '172.68.242.88'),
